Upstream libcamera (v0.7.2-204-gdcc6bf18, branch joan-android in ~/android/ref/libcamera-upstream:
bionic and Android HAL fixes for joan) cross-built with NDK r30:
  pipelines=simple ipas=softisp android=enabled android_platform=generic
  prefix=/vendor libdir=lib64 libexecdir=bin sysconfdir=etc datadir=etc
libjpeg-turbo 3.0.4, libexif 0.6.25 and libyuv are linked statically.
Build recipe: ~/android/tools/camera-build (see lc-setup.log).
camera.libcamera.so is libcamera-hal.so (the camera3 HAL module).
